#: ../../administration/roles/roles.rst:15
msgid ""
"Feature access control not only applies to the |morpheus| UI but also "
"applies to the public developer API. It is sometimes necessary to logout "
"and back in for changes to a users feature access level to be respected."
msgstr ""
"Característica acceso control no solo se aplica a el |morpheus| UI pero "
"también se aplica a el público desarrollador API. Es a veces necessary a "
"logout y back en para changes a a usuarios acceso a características nivel"
" a be respected."

#: ../../administration/roles/roles.rst:18
msgid "Role Types"
msgstr "Tipos de Rol"

#: ../../administration/roles/roles.rst:21
#: ../../administration/roles/roles_adding.rst:51
msgid "Tenant Roles"
msgstr "Roles de Inquilino"

#: ../../administration/roles/roles.rst:23
msgid ""
"A Tenant based role (formerly called an Account based role) is used to "
"ensure access control enforcement across an entire tenant with many sub-"
"users. This allows the subtenant to manage their own set of internal user"
" based roles without worrying master tenant involvement in setting them "
"up. The master tenant is the only tenant able to create and manage these "
"types of roles. When editing a Tenant, a singular tenant role can be "
"assigned to the account. Users within the tenant can be assigned roles "
"but those user based roles will never be able to supersede the level of "
"access granted by the tenant role. This allows a super administrator the "
"ability to restrict access at the department or organization level "
"without having to worry about per user access control within said tenant."
msgstr ""
"Un Inquilino basado rol (anteriormente llamado un Cuenta basado rol) se "
"utiliza para asegurar acceso control aplicación a través de un completo "
"inquilino con muchos sub-usuarios. Este permite el subinquilino a manage "
"su own establecido de internal usuario basado roles sin worrying "
"inquilino maestro involvement en setting them up. El inquilino maestro es"
" el solo inquilino able a crear y manage estos tipos de roles. Cuando "
"editing a Inquilino, a singular rol de inquilino puede ser asignado a el "
"cuenta. Usuarios dentro de el inquilino puede ser asignado roles pero "
"esos usuario basado roles va a never be able a supersede el nivel de "
"acceso granted por el rol de inquilino. Este permite a super "
"administrator el ability a restringir acceso en el department o "
"organization nivel sin having a worry acerca de per usuario acceso "
"control dentro de said inquilino."

#: ../../administration/roles/roles.rst:25
msgid ""
"Tenant roles also have an additional section not in User based roles "
"related to Cloud Access. Cloud Access allows the master tenant the "
"ability to assign cloud integration resources to specific subtenants or "
"groups of subtenants. An example would be granting access to a specific "
"VMware cluster only to a subset of tenants using the tenant based role "
"control."
msgstr ""
"Inquilino roles también tienen un adicional sección no en Usuario basado "
"roles relacionado con Nube Acceso. Nube Acceso permite el inquilino "
"maestro el ability a assign cloud integración recursos a específico "
"subinquilinos o grupos de subinquilinos. Un ejemplo would be granting "
"acceso a a específico VMware clúster solo a a subset de inquilinos usando"
" el inquilino basado rol control."

#: ../../administration/roles/roles.rst:28
#: ../../administration/roles/roles_adding.rst:5
msgid "User Roles"
msgstr "Roles de Usuario"

#: ../../administration/roles/roles.rst:30
msgid ""
"User roles can be created by any tenant given permission at the tenant "
"role level. These allow tenants to manage their own sets of users and "
"their levels of access. They also allow tenants to control which users "
"have access to specific “Groups” for provisioning into within |morpheus|."
" Groups are not cross tenant and therefore need to be controlled within "
"the individual tenant in |morpheus|."
msgstr ""
"Usuario roles puede ser creado por cualquier inquilino given permiso en "
"el rol de inquilino nivel. Estos permitir inquilinos a manage su own sets"
" de usuarios y su niveles de acceso. Ellos también permitir inquilinos a "
"control que usuarios tienen acceso a específico “Grupos” para "
"aprovisionamiento en dentro de |morpheus|. Grupos son no cross inquilino "
"y therefore need a be controlled dentro de el individual inquilino en "
"|morpheus|."

#: ../../administration/roles/roles.rst:32
msgid ""
"Master tenant users are able to create a special type of user role called"
" a multi-tenant user role. A multi-tenant user role is copied / "
"duplicated down to all subtenants within |morpheus|. These can be viewed "
"as canned role templates available to new tenants when their account is "
"first created. Any changes made to the main role are propagated down to "
"the subtenants version of the shared role so long as the subtenant users "
"have not previously adjusted/changed that role. The moment a subtenant "
"makes adjustments to the shared role within their account, it is unlinked"
" from the parent role and treated entirely independently. In order to "
"relink the Role in the Subtenant, a Master Tenant user would have to edit"
" the Role, uncheck MULTITENANT USER ROLE, save the Role, check "
"MULTITENANT USER ROLE once again, then save the Role once again."
msgstr ""
"Master inquilino usuarios son able a crear a special tipo de rol de "
"usuario llamado a multi-inquilino rol de usuario. Un multi-inquilino rol "
"de usuario es copied / duplicated down a todos subinquilinos dentro de "
"|morpheus|. Estos puede ser viewed as canned rol templates disponible a "
"nuevo inquilinos cuando su cuenta es first creado. Cualquier changes made"
" a el main rol son propagated down a el subinquilinos version de el "
"shared rol so long as el subinquilino usuarios tienen no previously "
"adjusted/changed ese rol. El moment a subinquilino makes adjustments a el"
" shared rol dentro de su cuenta, ello es unlinked desde el parent rol y "
"treated completamente independently. Para poder relink el Rol en el "
"Subinquilino, a Inquilino maestro usuario would tienen a editar el Rol, "
"uncheck MULTITENANT USER ROLE, save el Rol, check MULTITENANT USER ROLE "
"once again, then save el Rol once again."

#: ../../administration/roles/roles.rst:34
msgid ""
"Another note about user roles is that when a user role is copied down to "
"a subtenant, the permission scopes cannot supersede the tenant's assigned"
" tenant role. If they do they are automatically downgraded when "
"propagated to the specific tenant. Any changes made to the tenant role "
"will automatically ensure roles within the tenant are downgraded "
"appropriately."
msgstr ""
"Another note acerca de roles de usuario es ese cuando a rol de usuario es"
" copied down a a subinquilino, el permiso scopes cannot supersede el "
"inquilino's asignado rol de inquilino. Si ellos hacer ellos son "
"automáticamente downgraded cuando propagated a el específico inquilino. "
"Cualquier changes made a el rol de inquilino va a automáticamente "
"asegurar roles dentro de el inquilino son downgraded appropriately."

#: ../../administration/roles/roles.rst:36
msgid ""
"Master Tenant administrators may edit permissions for Roles in other "
"Tenants by viewing the Tenant detail page (|AdmTen| > Selected Tenant) "
"and accessing the Roles tab. From there, select the Role to edit and make"
" changes on the resulting Role detail page."
msgstr ""
"Inquilino maestro administrators puede editar permisos para Roles en otro"
" Inquilinos por viewing el Inquilino detalle página (|AdmTen| > Selected "
"Inquilino) y accessing el Roles pestaña. Desde there, seleccione el Rol a"
" editar y make changes en el resulting Rol detalle página."

#: ../../administration/roles/roles.rst:39
msgid "Multi-Tenant User Role Lock"
msgstr "Multi-Inquilino Rol de Usuario Lock"

#: ../../administration/roles/roles.rst:41
msgid ""
"As discussed above, Multi-Tenant User Roles are made available within all"
" Subtenants and can be thought of as ‘canned’ user role sets provided to "
"the Subtenant. |mastertenant| administrators can prevent changes to these"
" ‘canned’ user roles by marking the box labeled ‘MULTITENANT LOCKED’ when"
" creating or editing the role. In addition to preventing Subtenant "
"administrators from modifying permissions of the role copied down to "
"their Subtenant, this option also ensures |mastertenant| administrators "
"can propagate new changes to that role. Modification of the role by the "
"subtenant (if allowed) breaks the link back to the |mastertenant| and the"
" copy of the role within the Subtenant will become its own unlinked role."
msgstr ""
"As discussed above, Multi-Inquilino Roles de Usuario son made disponible "
"dentro de todos Subinquilinos y puede ser thought de as ‘canned’ rol de "
"usuario sets provided a el Subinquilino. |mastertenant| administrators "
"puede prevent changes a estos ‘canned’ roles de usuario por marking el "
"box labeled ‘MULTITENANT LOCKED’ cuando creando o editing el rol. En "
"addition a preventing Subinquilino administrators desde modifying "
"permisos de el rol copied down a su Subinquilino, este opción también "
"ensures |mastertenant| administrators puede propagate nuevo changes a ese"
" rol. Modification de el rol por el subinquilino (si allowed) breaks el "
"link back a el |mastertenant| y el copy de el rol dentro de el "
"Subinquilino serácome su own unlinked rol."

#: ../../administration/roles/roles.rst:43
msgid ""
"Multi-tenant role lock applies only to permission sets on the Features, "
"Report Types, Personas and VDI Pools tabs. Permissions in other tabs "
"(such as Groups, Instance Types, Blueprints or Catalog Item Types) tabs "
"are not locked. Similarly, changes made to the role on these tabs in the "
"master tenant are not synced down."
msgstr ""
"Multi-rol de inquilino lock se aplica solo a permiso sets en el "
"Características, Report Tipos, Personas y VDI Pools tabs. Permisos en "
"otro tabs (como Grupos, Tipos de Instancia, Blueprints o Catalog Item "
"Tipos) tabs son no locked. Similarly, changes made a el rol en estos tabs"
" en el inquilino maestro son no synced down."

#: ../../administration/roles/roles.rst:46
msgid "Editing User Roles in other Tenants"
msgstr "Editing Roles de Usuario en otro Inquilinos"

#: ../../administration/roles/roles.rst:48
msgid ""
"Administrators in the Primary Tenant have the unique ability to edit "
"feature permissions for User Roles that exist within other Tenants "
"(Subtenants). In order to view the Roles within the Tenant, navigate to "
"the Tenant detail page (|AdmTen|) and select the Roles tab. Click the "
"pencil (|pencil|) icon to the right of a Role in the list to edit basic "
"information, such as the name and description of the Role. Click on the "
"name of the Role to view its complete permission set and edit the "
"permissions if desired. This will update the feature access rights of "
"users in the selected Tenant which have the Role."
msgstr ""
"Administrators en el Primary Inquilino tienen el único ability a editar "
"característica permisos para Roles de Usuario ese existir dentro de otro "
"Inquilinos (Subinquilinos). Para poder view el Roles dentro de el "
"Inquilino, navegue a el Inquilino detalle página (|AdmTen|) y seleccione "
"el Roles pestaña. Haga clic en el pencil (|pencil|) icon a el right de a "
"Rol en el lista a editar basic information, como el nombre y description "
"de el Rol. Haga clic en el nombre de el Rol a view su complete permiso "
"establecido y editar el permisos si desired. Este va a update el acceso a"
" características rights de usuarios en el seleccionado Inquilino que "
"tienen el Rol."

#: ../../administration/roles/roles.rst:51
msgid "Roles and Identity Sources"
msgstr "Roles y Identidad Orígenes"

#: ../../administration/roles/roles.rst:53
msgid ""
"It is very common for large Enterprises to have an existing identity "
"source that they would like to plug in to |morpheus| for authentication. "
"This includes services like LDAP, Active Directory, OKTA, Jump Cloud, One"
" Login, and SAML. When using these services it becomes important to "
"configure a role mapping between the |morpheus| role assignments to the "
"equivalent identity source groups/roles the user belongs to. This is "
"configurable within the identity source management UI. Sections are "
"provided allowing things like LDAP groups to be directly mapped to "
"specific roles within |morpheus|. If a user matches more than one "
"LDAP/role group then both sets of roles are applied to the user "
"automatically. Configuring Identity Sources is done in Tenant management "
"or user management in |AdmTen| or |AdmUse|, and has to be configured on a"
" per-tenant basis. Additionally, administrators may opt to lock users to "
"their mapped role in |morpheus| or keep the roles unlocked to manually "
"administer roles in one-off scenarios."
msgstr ""
"Es very common para large Enterprises a tienen un existente identidad "
"origen ese ellos would like a plug en a |morpheus| para autenticación. "
"Este incluye services like LDAP, Active Directory, OKTA, Jump Nube, Uno "
"Inicio de sesión, y SAML. Cuando usando estos services ello becomes "
"important a configure a rol mapping entre el |morpheus| rol assignments a"
" el equivalent identidad origen grupos/rols el usuario belongs a. Este es"
" configurable dentro de el identidad origen gestión UI. Sections son "
"provided allowing things like LDAP grupos a be directly mapped a "
"específico roles dentro de |morpheus|. Si a usuario matches más than uno "
"LDAP/rol grupo then both sets de roles son aplicado a el usuario "
"automáticamente. Configuring Identidad Orígenes es done en Inquilino "
"gestión o usuario gestión en |AdmTen| o |AdmUse|, y tiene a be "
"configurado en a per-inquilino basis. Adicionalmente, administrators "
"puede opt a lock usuarios a su mapped rol en |morpheus| o keep el roles "
"unlocked a manually administer roles en uno-off scenarios."

#: ../../administration/roles/role_permissions.rst:2
msgid "Role Permissions"
msgstr "Rol Permisos"

#: ../../administration/roles/role_permissions.rst:4
msgid ""
"Permission options for sub-tenant user roles will only list options "
"permitted by the Tenant role applied to the sub-tenant. Sub-Tenant user "
"roles permissions cannot exceed permissions set by the overriding Tenant "
"Role."
msgstr ""
"Permiso opciones para sub-inquilino roles de usuario va a solo lista "
"opciones permitted por el Inquilino rol aplicado a el sub-inquilino. Sub-"
"Inquilino roles de usuario permisos cannot exceed permisos establecido "
"por el overriding Rol de Inquilino."

#: ../../administration/roles/role_permissions.rst:7
msgid "User Role Permission Sections"
msgstr "Rol de Usuario Permiso Sections"

#: ../../administration/roles/role_permissions.rst:8
#: ../../administration/roles/role_permissions.rst:33
msgid "Features"
msgstr "Características"

#: ../../administration/roles/role_permissions.rst:9
msgid ""
"Controls User access level for UI sections and features in |morpheus|. "
"The complete feature permissions grid is included below."
msgstr ""
"Controla Usuario acceso nivel para UI sections y características en "
"|morpheus|. El complete característica permisos grid es included below."

#: ../../administration/roles/role_permissions.rst:10
msgid "Groups"
msgstr "Grupos"

#: ../../administration/roles/role_permissions.rst:11
msgid ""
"Controls User access level for Groups. Groups are not a Multi-Tenant "
"construct, only Groups created in the current Tenant will be visible."
msgstr ""
"Controla Usuario acceso nivel para Grupos. Grupos son no a Multi-"
"Inquilino construct, solo Grupos creado en el actual Inquilino será "
"visible."

#: ../../administration/roles/role_permissions.rst:12
#: ../../administration/roles/role_permissions.rst:37
msgid "Instance Types"
msgstr "Tipos de Instancia"

#: ../../administration/roles/role_permissions.rst:13
msgid ""
"Controls User access level for Instance Types. Only Instance Types "
"created in the current Tenant or those created in the Master Tenant and "
"shared with the current Tenant will be available."
msgstr ""
"Controla Usuario acceso nivel para Tipos de Instancia. Solo Tipos de "
"Instancia creado en el actual Inquilino o esos creado en el Inquilino "
"maestro y shared con el actual Inquilino será disponible."

#: ../../administration/roles/role_permissions.rst:14
#: ../../administration/roles/role_permissions.rst:39
msgid "Blueprints"
msgstr "Blueprints"

#: ../../administration/roles/role_permissions.rst:15
msgid ""
"Controls User access level for Blueprints during App provisioning. Only "
"Blueprints created in the current Tenant or those created in the Master "
"Tenant and shared with the current Tenant will be available."
msgstr ""
"Controla Usuario acceso nivel para Blueprints durante App "
"aprovisionamiento. Solo Blueprints creado en el actual Inquilino o esos "
"creado en el Inquilino maestro y shared con el actual Inquilino será "
"disponible."

#: ../../administration/roles/role_permissions.rst:16
#: ../../administration/roles/role_permissions.rst:41
msgid "Report Types"
msgstr "Report Tipos"

#: ../../administration/roles/role_permissions.rst:17
msgid ""
"Controls User access for each report type in the Reports section "
"(|OpeRep|). The user must also have Operations: Reports access granted "
"under the Feature permissions tab."
msgstr ""
"Controla Usuario acceso para cada report tipo en el Reports sección "
"(|OpeRep|). El usuario debe también tienen Operations: Reports acceso "
"granted under el Característica permisos pestaña."

#: ../../administration/roles/role_permissions.rst:18
#: ../../administration/roles/role_permissions.rst:43
msgid "Personas"
msgstr "Personas"

#: ../../administration/roles/role_permissions.rst:19
#: ../../administration/roles/role_permissions.rst:44
msgid ""
"Controls User access to |morpheus| Personas, at the time of this writing "
"Users may be given access to the Standard (full |morpheus| UI "
"experience), API (no GUI access, API-only for service accounts), Virtual "
"Desktop (VDI), or Service Catalog Personas (simplified easy ordering "
"experience)"
msgstr ""
"Controla Usuario acceso a |morpheus| Personas, en el time de este writing"
" Usuarios puede be given acceso a el Standard (full |morpheus| UI "
"experience), API (no GUI acceso, API-solo para service cuentas), Virtual "
"Desktop (VDI), o Service Catalog Personas (simplified easy ordering "
"experience)"

#: ../../administration/roles/role_permissions.rst:20
#: ../../administration/roles/role_permissions.rst:45
msgid "Catalog Item Types"
msgstr "Catalog Item Tipos"

#: ../../administration/roles/role_permissions.rst:21
msgid ""
"Controls User access to Catalog Item types within the Service Catalog "
"Persona. Only Catalog Items created in the current Tenant or those "
"created in the Master Tenant and shared with the current Tenant will be "
"available."
msgstr ""
"Controla Usuario acceso a Catalog Item tipos dentro de el Service Catalog"
" Persona. Solo Catalog Items creado en el actual Inquilino o esos creado "
"en el Inquilino maestro y shared con el actual Inquilino será disponible."

#: ../../administration/roles/role_permissions.rst:22
#: ../../administration/roles/role_permissions.rst:47
msgid "Cluster Types"
msgstr "Clúster Tipos"

#: ../../administration/roles/role_permissions.rst:23
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Controls user access to Cluster types. Only Cluster types allowed for the"
" Role may be added in :menuselection:`Infrastructure --> Clusters` "
"(assuming the Role also has feature access to applicable permissions "
"related to adding Clusters)"
msgstr ""
"Controla usuario acceso a Clúster tipos. Solo Clúster tipos allowed para "
"el Rol puede be agregado en |InfClu| (assuming el Rol también tiene "
"acceso a características a applicable permisos relacionado con adding "
"Clústeres)"

#: ../../administration/roles/role_permissions.rst:24
#: ../../administration/roles/role_permissions.rst:49
msgid "VDI Pools"
msgstr "VDI Pools"

#: ../../administration/roles/role_permissions.rst:25
msgid ""
"Controls User access to VDI Pools which are currently configured "
"(|TooVDI|) via the Virtual Desktops Persona view"
msgstr ""
"Controla Usuario acceso a VDI Pools que son currently configurado "
"(|TooVDI|) a través de el Virtual Desktops Persona view"

#: ../../administration/roles/role_permissions.rst:26
#: ../../administration/roles/role_permissions.rst:51
msgid "Workflows"
msgstr "Flujos de trabajo"

